# Claude Code — Session Startup

At the start of every session, load your context DOT:

```
mcp__kilonova__dot_load(topic="claude_context")
```

This gives you current project state, active tasks, decisions, and patterns
without burning context window on recaps.

## Mid-session — persist what you learn

Use `kb_write` to save decisions and discoveries as they happen:

```
mcp__kilonova__kb_write(
  topic="claude_context",
  entity_type="decision",
  name="my-decision-slug",
  data={
    "name": "my-decision-slug",
    "project": "My Project",
    "decision": "What was decided",
    "rationale": "Why",
    "date": "2026-07-11"
  }
)
```

Entity types: project_state | decision | pattern | active_task | session_note
